 998:Src/main.c    ****     /* Collect confidence scores from the raw postprocess output for presence logic.
 999:Src/main.c    ****      * We don't use the smoothed features from the pipeline here to avoid a deadlock
1000:Src/main.c    ****      * where the pipeline doesn't update because no person is present, and no person
1001:Src/main.c    ****      * is present because the pipeline isn't updating. */
